{{DISPLAYTITLE:Getting Started}}
__TOC__

This page is a quick path from new user to active player.

== 1) Join the server ==
If onboarding is enabled, go to '''Immigration-Center''' and click the button to claim the '''Citizens''' role.

== 2) Claim your daily salary ==
Use:
* <code>/work</code>

You can do this once per daily reset window (resets at 06:00 Europe/Oslo).

== 3) Check your current job options ==
Use:
* <code>/job list</code>

Apply for upgrades with:
* <code>/job apply id:&lt;number&gt;</code>

== 4) Start fishing ==
Use:
* <code>/rod shop</code>
* <code>/rod buy tier:starter</code>
* <code>/rod equip tier:starter</code>
* <code>/fish cast</code>
* <code>/fish sell catch_id:last</code>

== 5) Watch egg events ==
Egg mini-games are announced in '''Special Place'''.  
Win mini-games to earn eggs, then hatch with:
* <code>/hatch</code>

== 6) Track your progress ==
Use:
* <code>/profile</code>
* <code>/leaderboard mode:richest</code>
* <code>/leaderboard mode:top_fish_value</code>

